<aside class="writing-draft-recovery" data-editor-recovery hidden aria-live="polite">
  <div>
    <p>发现未完成的本地写作</p>
    <span data-editor-recovery-description>浏览器在自动保存完成前保留了一份紧急副本。</span>
  </div>
  <div class="writing-draft-recovery__actions">
    <button type="button" data-editor-recovery-restore>恢复副本</button>
    <button type="button" data-editor-recovery-discard>保留已保存版本</button>
  </div>
</aside>
